0..75 Comment "// What codata refuses (#644). A family\'s kind is a computation universe; a"
76..152 Comment "// copattern block answers each observation once; a call claiming `>` is the"
153..227 Comment "// whole arm of a copattern block, and one anywhere else — under another"
228..303 Comment "// call, under `become`, outside any block — is refused by name until `>`"
304..360 Comment "// carries the sized rung\'s evidence (#392). The twin of"
361..399 Comment "// `../../model/codata/streams.gandr`."
